==================== Input ====================
/*
 * Css-mode token-soup math spacing is preserved per token: never invented,
 * never removed. Both cases distill conformance `css/parens/parens.css`
 * (adjacent props prop34 / prop44), where Prettier treats them as one class.
 */
/*
 * A source-spaced `+ 20px` argument keeps its space.
 * DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "unary-plus-glue"),
 * which glues it to `+20px`.
 */
a {
  prop34: func(+20px, + 20px);
}
/*
 * A source-glued `-(` stays glued in every position.
 * DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "css-glued-minus-paren"),
 * which splits only the binary-looking `3px -(4px)` into `3px - (4px)`
 * while keeping the bare `-(4px)` glued.
 */
a {
  prop: 3px -(4px);
  prop44: -(4px);
}

